<p>For a description of each metric, you can refer to the official Postgres documentation: <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/pgstatstatements.html#PGSTATSTATEMENTS-PG-STAT-STATEMENTS">The <code>pg_stat_statements</code> View</a>.</p>
<div class="admonition not-prose my-9 rounded-none border-l-2 bg-gray-new-98 py-4 pr-5 pl-[1.125rem] dark:bg-gray-new-8 border-[#2D8665] dark:border-green-52 [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-3 [&amp;_pre_code]:text-sm! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:bg-white! [&amp;_pre[data-language]]:dark:bg-gray-new-8!"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[#2D8665] dark:text-green-52"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="shrink-0"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m12 2 2 2-6.4 6.4-2.8.8.8-2.8z"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12.4 9.2v3.6a1.2 1.2 0 0 1-1.2 1.2h-8A1.2 1.2 0 0 1 2 12.8v-8a1.2 1.2 0 0 1 1.2-1.2h3.6"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[13px] leading-none font-medium -tracking-snug uppercase">What’s the performance impact of pg_stat_statements?</h4></div><div class="admonition-text mt-2.5 text-base leading-normal tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-85 [&amp;_a]:rounded-sm [&amp;_li]:text-base [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li]:tracking-extra-tight [&amp;_ul]:my-0 [&amp;_ol]:my-0"><p>Generally, <code>pg_stat_statements</code> is found to have a very small impact, and many users will keep it installed so that it’s available when needed. For a discussion on this topic, please see this <a href="https://dba.stackexchange.com/questions/303503/what-is-the-performance-impact-of-pg-stat-statements">Database Administrators Stack Exchange article</a>.</p></div></div>
<p>After allowing time for statistics to be collected, you can run queries like this one to start gathering data about your queries.</p>
<h3 id="long-running-queries" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Long-running queries</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#long-running-queries" aria-label="Link to Long-running queries"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
